[0033] applying a machine-learning algorithm trained accord- ing to the above method for providing a machine-learning algorithm for ob- ject detection to the first data set comprising the plu- rality of time series images for object detection;
and
[O034] outputting a second data set representing a result the object detection having annotated objects in said plurality of time series images.
[0035] According to yet another aspect of the present disclosure, there is provided a system for providing a machine-learning algorithm, where the system includes:
[0036] a training computer configured to train a first machine learning algorithm for object detection using a first training data of individual images based on sensor data of a vehicular environment,
the training computer being configured to train a second machine learning algorithm for object detection using a second data set consisting of a plurality of time series images;
and
a computer configured to execute a machine-learning algorithm trained according to the above method for providing a machine- learning algorithm for object detection for object detection."
