  "detailed_description": "[0022] Hereinafter, example aspects of the present disclo-sure will be described with reference to the accompanying drawings.
[0023] First, an overall configuration of an information pro-cessing system according to a first embodiment will be described with reference to FIGS. 1 and 2.
[0024] As illustrated in FIG. 1, the information processing system according to the present embodiment includes a terminal 100 and a server 200. The terminal 100 and the server 200 communicate wirelessly via a wireless communication network 300.
